  "content": {
    "id": "p25-q3-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Xuan is saving up for a holiday. She invests $\\$800$ at the end of each year at 7.5% p.a.\nHow much will she have for her holiday after 5 years’ time? Give your answer to the nearest cent.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$4646.71$",
      "worked": "End of 1st year: $800$\n\nEnd of 2nd year: $800(1.075)+800$\n\nEnd of 5th year: $800(1.075)^4+800(1.075)^3+\\cdots+800$\n\nThis is a geometric series with $a=800$, common ratio $R=1.075$ and $n=5$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}FV&=\\frac{a(R^n-1)}{R-1}\\\\&=\\frac{800(1.075^5-1)}{1.075-1}\\\\&=4646.7128125\\\\&\\approx\\$4646.71\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
